Sheepdog Sim asset policy

Source code is licensed separately under GNU AGPL-3.0-or-later.

Runtime and authoring assets in this repository may be used, modified and
redistributed only under the license recorded in the nearest asset ledger. An
asset without a recorded redistributable license must not enter a public release
or deployment.

Project-authored procedural geometry, deterministic bake outputs and original
authoring sources are distributed with the corresponding source code unless a
nearby ledger states otherwise.

Generated media must record the provider, generation date, prompt or recipe,
processing steps and file digest. Generated media is distributed only when the
account and provider terms permit that use.

No visual or audio asset from Sheepdog Sim version 2 is automatically licensed
for the version 3 runtime. Third-party assets remain under their own terms and
are never relicensed merely by inclusion in this repository.
